   <crs:Description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Color negative film approximation. ISO 400. Everyday Fuji consumer look; strong on foliage and skies. Visual approximation built from Lightroom sliders; not an exact reproduction.</rdf:li>
